Package: spdw-stream-portal
Version: @VERSION@
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-tk, python3-pil, python3-pil.imagetk, procps
Recommends: pkexec | policykit-1, xfconf
Suggests: dolphin-emu, tailscale
Maintainer: SPDW Factory Lab <spdw@localhost>
Homepage: https://github.com/SilverCrow2323/mockrt-core
Description: MockRt:Core Stream Portal - PC side for GameCube/Wii streaming to a muOS handheld
 GameCube-style 2.5D control panel (SPDW Factory Lab). Builds the game library
 with cover art from ROMs kept on the PC, registers every game as a Sunshine app
 (Dolphin in batch mode, fullscreen, XFCE panel hidden while streaming, 4:3 display mode so the stream fills the handheld screen), serves
 the library to the handheld and manages autostart of Sunshine, the library
 server and the portal itself at XFCE login (optional LightDM autologin).
 Sunshine is installed separately (the portal can fetch the .deb from GitHub).
